    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Refresh logic\n**Knowledge base = the 7 PlacidWay URLs from the brief only.**\n\n1. **Weekly Refresh** (Mon 03:00) or **Refresh Now** (manual) runs the 7 HTTP Request nodes one after another (sequential = about 1 request/sec, clear User-Agent, robots.txt allows these paths).\n2. **Extract Clean Page Text** keeps only the page's main content, removes scripts/menus and caps each page at 20k chars.\n3. **Save Knowledge Base** upserts one row per page (key = source_key) into the itc_knowledge_base Data Table, so pages are replaced, never duplicated. A failed page is stored as \"could not be fetched\" and the bot falls back honestly.\n4. Every chat message loads the latest rows, merges them into the knowledge_base variable and gives it to the agent - no restart needed after a refresh.\n\nRun **Refresh Now** once before the first chat. Unanswered questions are logged with answered = false in itc_chat_log to find content gaps.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 520
      },
